{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行に行事で行くと行ったのですが、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーーーっと.........なんといったらいいのでしょう........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがそれがぁ......曜日を間違ったのではなくてぇー感覚を間違った！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、もぅここは曜日って言った方がいい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ、言い訳を言いますとぉー、\n16日の日曜じゃないですかぁー！\n私がblog更新したの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、もぅ合宿だからblog更新出来ないなぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙\nっと思った訳ですよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、えーっとぉ......少し旅行にいく時間？日にちがあるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今こうして更新しておりまふ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許してください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかてかコメント皆面白すぎるー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の質問答えてくれてありがもー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも天然じゃないですかぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎてついに......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校帰り川後のひなさんと待ち合わせて原宿に行ったよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会の時の服を見たりした！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は折りたたみ傘を買った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミツバチとかの絵が書いてあった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、バットマンのリュックサック買った！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんは、物は買ってないけど、\nタピオカとか食べ物食べてた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは、\nチェロス？違う！チュリトス？違う！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか長い食べ物食べた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、急に私、シャックリがでだして、とまらんくなったんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『なんか問題出してー』\n川後\n『えっ！？なんで？急にどした？』\n和田\n『頭を使うとシャックリとまるんだってー！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからずっと、問題を出し続けてくれた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構な問題の量だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも結局とまんなかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がシャックリを解決してくれた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さん......ごめんよ......！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが書いたメンバーの似顔絵"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマト、ゆったん！かなりん！ろってぃーを書いたよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必殺技とか将来の夢とか、その人のプロフィール作った！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し、少ししたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏サンフレッチェの試合いく時間あった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってないです〜涙\nイヤー行きたいです！TVで見るばかりで、なかなか見にいけてないなぁー涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会で名前いうから言ったらわかってもらえるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogコメントとか、よく来てくださる方ならわかるんですけど......！涙\n名前言って下さったらわかるかも〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松茸とかスキ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理の仕方によって食べれるときと食べれないときがあります！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今スッゴク落ち込んでヤバイです！気持ち切り替えようと思ってもなかなかうまくいかない......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたんですか？涙\nうーん！\n内容が分からないから何てアドバイスすればいいのかわからないです！涙\nでもパワー届けー!!(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で何を話せばいいかわかりません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも大丈夫！来てくださるだけでも嬉んで！照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別で、本人にないしょでお父さんきたことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！それはないです！\nでもよくメンバーの家族さんが握手会来たり、楽屋に来たりしてくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、質問たまってるんで、待っててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会きてくれるかた？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れないけど応援してくれる方？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会来ないし、応援してないは、なしです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では行ってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7581774/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}